# Fixture: map_found_colony start (France 1599, human = French).
# CHEAT Set Human Player (Shift-F5) to ANOTHER nation (DOS case 0x66; port_bugs.md #1172): English, row 1. The one-nation Europe mirror is flushed onto
# the French record first and England's own record is bound, so the English Europe screen (E) shows England's gold/tax/dock, not France's 429 gold.
# Saved: human_player = nation_turn = curr_nation_map_view = 0, control[0] = 0, control[1] = 1; France's Europe state stays on nation[1].
# Ends with cheat mode off again (Alt-W).
key w alt
key i alt
key n alt
key F5 shift
key Return               # English
wait 30
shot
key e                    # English European Status
wait 30
shot
key Escape
wait 30
shot
key w alt
